# ── The vendored Tailwind build.
# It is COMMITTED on purpose, and this file must NOT ignore it: week 13's exam room has
# no internet, and a project whose stylesheet arrives over the network does not render
# in it. If you find yourself adding `vendor/` here, stop and read the brief again.

# ── Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp

# ── Nothing else belongs here.
# There is no build step in this project except `tsc`, and js/types.js — its output —
# IS committed, because the browser loads it and the grader runs the page as it is in
# your repository. `node_modules/` is listed below only as a guard: if it ever appears
# in this folder, something was installed that the course does not allow.
node_modules/
